This is a modified distribution of software originally published as
au.com.console:kassava (https://github.com/consoleau/kassava). The original
work is copyright RES INFORMATION SERVICES PTY LTD, and its author is credited
as James Bassett in the source files.

The following changes were made to the original work:

  - The Kotlin package moved from au.com.console.kassava to
    dev.nemecec.kassava, and the artifact is published under the matching
    coordinates dev.nemecec.kassava:kassava.
  - The build moved from Gradle 6 with Kotlin 1.3 to Gradle 9 with Kotlin 2.4,
    and publishes to Maven Central rather than Bintray.
  - kotlin-reflect is no longer a dependency.
  - The tests were rewritten from Spek 2 and hamkrest to JUnit 5.
  - The public declarations are explicitly public (Kotlin explicit API mode),
    and the sources are formatted with ktfmt.

CHANGELOG.md records these in full, along with anything added since.
